     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div>Dear Mentors and Students,</div><div><br></div><div>Just posted two new project ideas on <a href=\"https://github.com/rstats-gsoc/gsoc2017/wiki/table-of-proposed-coding-projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstats-gsoc/gsoc2017/wiki/table-of-proposed-coding-projects&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351476632000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3rmFRdm7KlerWjWIU16VFo\">ideas page</a> related to biodiversity data.</div><div><br></div><div>First one is <a href=\"https://github.com/rstats-gsoc/gsoc2017/wiki/Integrating-biodiversity-data-curation-functionality\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,120,192);text-decoration:none;font-family:-apple-system,blinkmacsystemfont,&quot;segoe ui&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif,&quot;apple color emoji&quot;,&quot;segoe ui emoji&quot;,&quot;segoe ui symbol&quot;\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstats-gsoc/gsoc2017/wiki/Integrating-biodiversity-data-curation-functionality&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351476633000&amp;usg=AOvVaw10y-Rm3BifAkB4Lw0hVcKX\">Integrating biodiversity data curation functionality</a> dealing with integrating several data cleaning functions available is different packages in a single workflow.</div><div><br></div><div>Second one is <a href=\"https://github.com/rstats-gsoc/gsoc2017/wiki/Biodiversity-data-cleaning\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);color:rgb(64,120,192);outline-width:0px;font-family:-apple-system,blinkmacsystemfont,&quot;segoe ui&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif,&quot;apple color emoji&quot;,&quot;segoe ui emoji&quot;,&quot;segoe ui symbol&quot;\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstats-gsoc/gsoc2017/wiki/Biodiversity-data-cleaning&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351476633000&amp;usg=AOvVaw132VCkxYv75W8ilYsvJYaA\">Biodiversity data cleaning</a> which will deal with adding new functionality to biodiversity data cleaning pipelines. </div><div><br></div><div>Mentors please provide your feedback on the ideas. And students, if you are interested in the ideas, work on the tests and contact us.</div><div><br></div><div>Regards,</div><div><br></div><div>Vijay</div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">-- </span><br></div></font></span></div></div><div class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>---<br>Vijay Barve<br><a href=\"http://vijaybarve.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://vijaybarve.net/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351476633000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Wr9aIFd73FadsJKHJOg_j\">http://vijaybarve.net/</a><br>---</div></div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n"
